# Task
Analyze the traces and feedback. Propose clause-level edits to the strategy layer:
1. ATTRIBUTE: which existing clause caused failures (blame) / which was validated (support)?
2. EDIT: add / modify / delete specific clauses (output a diff, not a full rewrite).
3. DISTILL: propose candidate rules (trigger → action) for failures not covered by strategy.
4. CLASSIFY each edit as "principle" (broadly applicable) or "patch" (narrow edge-case).

Prefer minimal, targeted edits. Keep broadly-applicable strategies general;
push task-specific fixes to the rule candidates instead of the strategy layer.
